Comment: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a bazaar at Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be sure to come by!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Squishy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, is that you, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who else looks like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you gonna keep your hand there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Koba{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you napping in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're tired, you should go home and rest in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't napping!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen to you, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.33,0:02:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "something"!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.34,0:02:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you tell just by looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.82,0:02:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're all muddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:03:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, shut up and listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gotten pretty cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.03,0:03:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it will clear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna go get something that's sure to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now of course, no way I'd really do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sick and tired of hanging around the nursery acting like a stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna go see that bear and get myself some baumkuchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, he always puts it in such weird places.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One long!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Four slices!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is the short one done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One slice, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Slices for a party of three are done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is mine done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a sec, it's cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Six slices done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about the long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.73,0:04:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Two more minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you're doing pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was Zuisho's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to try variations, too. Like a chocolate one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't sound half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You two sure are getting along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't sure at first, but it seems to be going great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You couldn't even tell I was being sarcastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! We deliver now, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're from the Bear's Baumkuchery?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been waiting. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, you're not the bird like usual. Did you just start?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're just part-time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I used to have a part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My boss sent me all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One time I went to this place, almost like a labyrinth, full of strange rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so caught up in this that I can't even remember what you used to be like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing wrong with this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.65,0:05:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bit hairy, if I put my mind to it I can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's scary how used to it I am. I feel like I've been this way my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:06:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It all seems like a dream now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More like a nightmare for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It feels like it's been such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you actually think it through, there's no way we could have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We bit off more than we could chew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like trying to arm-wrestle an octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We lost so quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I kind of remember throwing someone overboard trying to save myself, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was you, Ginko!? Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have time now to get riled up over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, we sure were{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.03,0:06:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you hadn't gone along with it, the rules are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All I can do now is keep cooking my baumkuchen and wait for things to cool down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:06:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still have my regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to regret!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I object!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.93,0:07:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't even think anything that terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! Next time we make it to Heaven, we're not gonna end up as bears and birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be a teddy bear! And he'll end up as birdseed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.93,0:07:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you get to be the cute one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, just don't cause any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.23,0:07:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't eat that! That's my inventory!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, he only gave me one box to take home. What a stingy bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm, after sweets maybe I should have something salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then after that, more of this baumkuchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Soy would be fine too, but right now I'm in the mood for salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, my stomach's growling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, the ball came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's so fun about kicking a ball around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell is this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:08:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not your dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These are mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No baumkuchen for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now knock it off or I'll roast you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.73,0:09:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}not{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}giving{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}you{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}this{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}even{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}if{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}I{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.18,0:09:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, not water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting worn out...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.01,0:09:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I'm gonna hork up more than just fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.67,0:10:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My body feels so heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, when it rains, it pours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can dry right out in one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.24,0:10:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dryers are tougher than I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that grocer...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! I'm gonna take my time and enjoy it after I get home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a little kid, I can wait until I'm done. ... Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This tasty smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's {\i1}that{\i0} mysterious life-form?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to Mocona Land! {inb4 blogging that I don't know to spell it mokona}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Young ladies and gentlemen, don't have so much fun that you get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But be sure to have lots of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I sure have ended up somewhere weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right! That smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They all seem so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:12:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Hey, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit, I may be a stuffed animal now, but I'm not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't get out of here quick, someone's gonna take my baumkuchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.45,0:13:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, where's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.39,0:13:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get whichever one you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, don't tell me{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa, I want that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A shooting range!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.01,0:14:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa, I want the blue doggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.35,0:14:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoops, I missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nothing to laugh about!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, this time I'll get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! It's coming straight at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You missed again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.59,0:15:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, that's weird. Okay, this time for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, did it move?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It didn't move, you just can't aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, now you've got me riled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.68,0:15:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right! I'll get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit, grow up! Stop being so stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is horrible!{federation's wh(ry}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He sure is hard to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I may look like this now, but they used to call me "Kana the Sniper".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who the hell are you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, you've got to get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's all work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't I hit that blue thing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not gonna be some brat's souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I saw it fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We all saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:17:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, that sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:18:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At least I'm safe now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you've been running around all this time after the posters got taken down?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one would come otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least you're optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.34,0:18:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if they hadn't been taken down, you were getting too excited about a nursery school's bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If this was going to happen, I probably shouldn't have even suggested it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, once you've decided on something it's important to go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if things get messed up, you can't just quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.37,0:18:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you're sopping wet, even if you're ambushed by a sniper...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O... kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Er, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.57,0:18:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get too disappointed just because there aren't any customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.69,0:19:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look how much we sold!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The teru-teru bouzu sold too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You showed me some real bargains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.49,0:19:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you just gonna stand there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.79,0:19:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have enough people to handle this many customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. We only have this many customers because you tried so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't really{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:19:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.67,0:20:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They look like they're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all thanks to you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto! Thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.77,0:20:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I really wanted to buy something from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? I made things!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They didn't sell...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. Who would want some mysterious life-form where they can't even tell whether it's a chicken, a penguin, or a sheep?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.17,0:20:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about I buy one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really, really you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, a bunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.86,0:21:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This was such a wonderful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sucked for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Weren't you listening to me!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.64,0:21:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.89,0:21:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't just guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well, as long as I still have {\i1}that{\i0}, all's well that ends well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll scarf it down as soon as I get home! No, wait, I'll savor it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.27,0:21:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.33,0:21:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.41,0:21:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.75,0:21:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.77,0:21:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My baumkuchen's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I'm gonna have to go back to the nursery and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.85,0:21:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right, the baumkuchen. That sold right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.80,0:21:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell did you do!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You said you were going to get something that wass sure to sell. That was the baumkuchen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.47,0:22:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a ton!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your score for today is 80 points for your enthusiasm about the bazaar, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,a total of -300 for my disappointment!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why, Ioryogi!? Are you disappointed because of me? I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.69,0:22:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't apologize it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.94,0:22:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll cheer you up by giving you one of my cute bunnies!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.13,0:22:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't need one of those!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.22,0:22:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What if I throw a second one in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.73,0:22:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.27,0:22:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about this cute bear and sheep?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't even tell which is which! They're all mysterious life-forms!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.64,0:22:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're terrible, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.04,0:01:09.92,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.92,0:01:18.22,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.22,0:01:28.02,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.52,0:01:33.82,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.82,0:01:41.58,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.58,0:01:47.25,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.25,0:01:52.46,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.46,0:01:58.76,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.76,0:02:04.43,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.43,0:02:11.15,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.15,0:02:19.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.54,0:02:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Mysterious Life-form.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.64,0:23:07.82,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.49,0:23:15.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.91,0:23:23.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.92,0:23:31.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.30,0:23:42.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.35,0:23:45.69,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.23,0:23:54.12,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 1,0:23:54.12,0:24:01.21,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 1,0:24:02.00,0:24:10.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.80,0:24:14.89,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 1,0:24:16.60,0:24:28.02,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.02,0:24:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}... Warmth in a Chill Wind.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.02,0:24:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMedrano\bord0\shad0\pos(331,192)\frz355.15\c&HBECFD3&}Bear's Baumkuchery
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMedrano\bord0\shad0\frz356.878\pos(332,394)\c&H556EB8&}Happy Hour
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMedrano\bord0\shad0\c&HB0C7CD&\frz355.982\pos(333,233)}On Break
